Section: 1 Introduction
Text: Given two paragraphs, whether the second paragraph comes really after the ﬁrst one or the order has been reversed. It is the way of learning the arrow of times in the stories and can be very beneﬁcial in neural story generation tasks. Moreover, this is a self-supervised task, which means the labels come from the text itself.

