Text: i.e., given only two paragraphs, arXiv:1903.10548v1 [cs.CL] 25 Mar 2019 determining which comes ﬁrst and which comes next is a difﬁcult task even for humans. In this paper, we have collected and curated a novel dataset for tackling this challenging task. We have shown that a pre-trained BERT architecture achieves reasonable accuracy on the task, and outperforms RNN-based architectures.

